# 03 Executive Indexes

The four composite scores. Read in order: the pillars that feed each index, then the index, then the tier that turns a number into a word.

Read in file order — each measure builds on the ones before it.

- **`01_GPI_Pillar_1_Absolute.dax`** — Where the market stands today.
- **`02_GPI_Pillar_2_Trend.dax`** — Which direction it is moving.
- **`03_GPI_Score.dax`** — Geographic Performance Index, 0-100.
- **`04_GPI_Tier.dax`** — Excellent through Critical.
- **`05_GPI_Rank_Dynamic.dax`** — Rank at whichever geography is selected.
- **`06_Portfolio_GPI_Score.dax`** — Portfolio-level GPI.
- **`07_GPI_vs_Portfolio.dax`** — A market against the portfolio.
- **`08_Occupancy_Actual.dax`** — Occupancy component of OPI.
- **`09_Vacancy_Actual.dax`** — Vacancy component, inverted.
- **`10_Absorption_Actual.dax`** — Absorption component.
- **`11_Coverage_Actual.dax`** — Forward coverage component.
- **`12_Operations_Index_Score.dax`** — Operations Performance Index, 0-100.
- **`13_Ops_Index_Tier.dax`** — Tier label for OPI.
- **`14_Awareness_Impressions_Percentile.dax`** — One vendor's impressions as a percentile.
- **`15_Awareness_Score.dax`** — Awareness stage score.
- **`16_Consideration_Score.dax`** — Consideration stage score.
- **`17_Evaluation_Score.dax`** — Evaluation stage score.
- **`18_Conversion_Score.dax`** — Conversion stage score.
- **`19_VPI_SingleVendor_Score.dax`** — One vendor's weighted funnel score.
- **`20_Vendor_Performance_Index.dax`** — Vendor Performance Index, 0-100.
- **`21_VPI_Performance_Tier.dax`** — Tier label for VPI.
- **`22_Portfolio_Health_Operations.dax`** — Operations contribution to PHI.
- **`23_Portfolio_Health_Marketing_Funnel.dax`** — Funnel contribution to PHI.
- **`24_Portfolio_Health_Geo_Marketing.dax`** — Geographic contribution to PHI.
- **`25_Portfolio_Health_Index.dax`** — Portfolio Health Index, 0-100.
